        interval '-1 year 2 months 1 day 23 hours 45 min +12.34 sec';
   interval   |    interval    |       interval       |       interval        
--------------+----------------+----------------------+-----------------------
 -23:45:12.34 | -1 23:45:12.34 | -1-2 -1 -23:45:12.34 | -0-10 +1 +23:45:12.34
(1 row)

